      <title>Shrinkwrap 0.5.3</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Tag one image and it's replaced in place: photo@600sq.jpg alone in an ordinary folder is shrunk where it sits, with the original moved to the Trash and no z_originals, backups, or log files left behind. Folders you've already set up with @ folders behave exactly as before.</p>]]></description>
